repository-code: "https://github.com/yelleKneK/BUCSS"
repository-artifact: "https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=BUCSS"
abstract: >-
  Implements a method of correcting for publication bias and uncertainty when
  planning sample sizes in a future study from an original study, so that the
  planned study reaches the power it was intended to have.
keywords:
  - R package
  - sample size planning
  - statistical power
  - publication bias
  - effect size uncertainty
  - replication
